- Introduce collapsible sections or a separately scrollable div on the template dashboard settings, and tell Omar
- Build image upload feature into template editor. Support default banner images and image avatars, with default images set, maybe some kind of global library feature across templates...
- Build favicon generator into template editor. Make it distinct from avatar. Generate proper favicons from uploaded avatars (to prevent streched favicons when non-square avatars are uploaded)
